This software is built with [p5.js](https://p5js.org/) and [Tone.js](https://tonejs.github.io/).

The concept of using an elementary cellular automaton to generate music is heavily inspired by the exploration done at [WolframTones](https://tones.wolfram.com/).

The ASCII font is modified from the [code page 437](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Code_page_437) character set available in the public domain.

All other code is hand-crafted with 💙 by Craig Phares.
